        mistake: 'Pulling fries that still feel soft inside when you break one open.',
        consequence: 'The interior is still slightly damp and will soften further as it cools and steam is reabsorbed. You end up eating fries that firm up for 30 seconds and then start to go limp again as they cool, losing the crisp texture.',
