      'Color progression in the wrapper moves from pale cream to light tan around minute 6, to golden around minute 8, to deep brown if left past 9.5 minutes. Golden is the target color; deep brown means the wrapper is overdone, and the filling inside will be dry from having been held above the safe minimum too long.',
