      'Place taquitos seam-side-down in a single layer so the oiled seam side receives direct contact with the hot basket and oil, crisping the seam and helping it stay sealed. Seam-side-up exposes the seam to steam from the filling cooling at the surface, which can weaken the seal and cause the tortilla to unroll during cooking.',
