        q: 'Do I need to shake or flip taquitos halfway through cooking?',
        a: 'No; taquitos at seam-side-down in a single layer will brown evenly on all sides without flipping because the convection is 360-degree around each piece at 380°F. Flipping or shaking introduces risk of splitting the seam or dislodging the tortilla from the filling.',
