        prevention: 'Commit to 2 full minutes of contact per side before the first touch. Use the nudge test at the 90-second mark (gentle push with a spatula to see if it glides) rather than checking by moving the steak. If it resists the nudge at 90 seconds, let it sit another 30 seconds before attempting to flip.',
