        mistake: 'Salting the chili heavily at the start, based on how bland the raw ingredients taste before the beans have released their starch.',
        consequence: 'As the beans thicken the broth, the chili concentrates in flavor, so salt added assertively early can taste oversalted by the time it\'s fully thickened.',
