        q: 'I mashed a cup of beans like the pro tip says, but the chili is still thin — what happened?',
        a: 'The most likely cause is mashing beans that were still somewhat firm, since a firmer bean hasn\'t released as much of its interior starch yet. Mash later in the cook once the beans are clearly soft, or mash a bit more if yours still feel firm.',
