      'Test the bend by pinching a single elbow between thumb and forefinger: al dente pasta bends slightly under light pressure but the tube will not collapse or deform easily. Overcooked pasta collapses immediately with almost no resistance. The interior of a bitten elbow should show a thin, pale-yellow or cream line no wider than a thread running through the cross-section; if it is thick and obvious, the pasta needs another 30 seconds.',
