      'Pick a pot with real headroom above the combined water-and-lentil line for the initial uncovered boil. Dry lentils release enough surface starch in the first couple minutes that a pot filled close to the rim is prone to a foamy boilover right before you\'d otherwise drop the heat and cover it.',
