        prevention: 'The pro tip specifies boiling the wine separately for 2 minutes before adding it. If you skipped that step, you can recover by reducing the finished braise uncovered over medium-high heat for 5-10 minutes to evaporate more alcohol, though this is less ideal than doing it first.',
