    proTip: 'The 1-minute cook time is not a typo: quinoa cooks primarily during the pressurized heat-up and 10-minute natural release descent. Quick-releasing immediately or cooking for 3+ minutes explodes the grain shells and produces waterlogged porridge. Let the 10-minute natural rest finish the gentle steam.',
