    oilSprayRequired: false,
    proTip: 'Use boneless skinless chicken thighs rather than chicken breast — breasts turn stringy and dry during a 20-minute curry simmer, while dark meat thighs contain enough intramuscular fat and gelatin to stay luscious and tender in the rich acidic sauce.',
