    cutOrPrep: '1 lb dry brown or green lentils rinsed and picked over, 8 cups low-sodium vegetable broth, mirepoix (2 carrots / 2 celery ribs / 1 onion), 1 can diced tomatoes, 2 bay leaves — no acid added early',
