    appliance: 'sheet-pan',
    cutOrPrep: '2 lb baby (1.5-inch) Yukon Gold or creamer potatoes halved through the equator so every piece has one flat cut face, tossed with 3 tbsp olive oil, 1.5 tsp kosher salt, and cracked black pepper, arranged CUT-FACE-DOWN in a single spaced layer on an unlined rimmed half-sheet pan',
    state: 'fresh',
    tempF: 425,
    tempC: 218,
