    appliance: 'sheet-pan',
    cutOrPrep: '1.5 lb whole cremini (baby bella) mushrooms wiped clean with a damp paper towel (never rinsed under running water), stems trimmed flush, tossed with 2 tbsp olive oil, 1 tsp kosher salt, and 1/2 tsp cracked black pepper, spread in a single spaced layer on an unlined rimmed half-sheet pan, gill-side up',
    state: 'fresh',
