        q: 'Can I use frozen peanuts instead of fresh or dried?',
        a: 'Frozen green peanuts can work if they\'re raw-green-frozen, but freezing ruptures cell walls and may shorten cooking time by 1-2 hours. Thaw them first if using frozen, or add them directly to the simmering water and reduce the cook time estimate.',
