        prevention: 'Add half the water immediately (about 2.5 tablespoons for 1/3 cup total), stir once to deglaze any stuck bits, and wait 1–2 minutes for bubbling to resume before adding the remaining water. This staged approach lets the pan recover heat between additions.',
