        prevention: 'Batch cook if necessary. A 10-inch cast iron skillet holds about 5 U/10 scallops (roughly 2 inches wide) with comfortable spacing, or 6–7 U/15 scallops (roughly 1.5 inches). If you have more, use two pans or two batches.',
