        q: 'Is there a flavor difference between beer braising and butter braising?',
        a: 'Beer adds a subtle malty sweetness and mild bitterness that balances bratwurst\'s herbal spices; butter adds richness but is more neutral. Beer is traditional in German bratwurst cooking, while butter-based braises are common in Austrian or modern American versions. Try beer first if you want the authentic approach.',
