    internalTempTargetFormatted: '195°F–203°F (91°C–95°C) tender between bones',
    restMinutes: 15,
    donenessCue: 'Meat pulled back 1/2 inch from bone ends; rack bends easily and surface cracks when held with tongs at one end.',
