        prevention: 'Place the knife tip just at the base of the stem nub and draw it diagonally inward at a 45-degree angle toward the bean\'s center. You should remove only the stem attachment point, leaving 1-1.5 inches of the pod intact. This keeps the pod sealed while removing the inedible part',
