      'Distribute the crushed tomatoes and peppers as a bed on the pot bottom before or after browning the drumsticks, depending on your technique. If you add them before browning, they cool the oil; if you add them after, make sure to distribute them so the pooling liquid doesn\'t isolate the drumsticks from each other. They should nestle around and under the sticks.',
