        a: 'Broiling from above only would cook the top side much faster than the bottom side in contact with the iron, creating streaky, uneven color; the oven\'s combined radiant heat from top and sides and the pan\'s conducted heat from below are what make this recipe work. Broiler-only would need constant flipping.',
