    keywords: ["how long to braise italian sausage coins with bell peppers & onions", "italian sausage coins with bell peppers & onions dutch oven time", "italian sausage coins with bell peppers & onions dutch oven temperature", "dutch oven italian sausage coins with bell peppers & onions", "italian sausage coins with bell peppers & onions internal temp"],
    metaDescription: 'Simmer Italian sausage coins with bell peppers and onions in a Dutch oven on stovetop for 25 to 30 minutes for a quick, savory one-pot dinner.',
