    keywords: ["how long to braise slow cooker ground turkey & cannellini white chili", "slow cooker ground turkey & cannellini white chili dutch oven time", "slow cooker ground turkey & cannellini white chili dutch oven temperature", "dutch oven slow cooker ground turkey & cannellini white chili", "slow cooker ground turkey & cannellini white chili internal temp"],
    metaDescription: 'Simmer ground turkey and white bean chili in a Dutch oven for 45 to 50 minutes on low heat for hearty, healthy, fiber-rich comfort soup.',
